Following your application for the position of {title}, we would like to invite you to an interview.

Date and time: {when}
Duration: {duration}
Format / location: {mode}
Interviewers: {interviewers}

Please confirm by return that the proposed time suits you, or propose an alternative.

{signature}',
'et.d_b_rc_offer' => 'Dear {name},

We are pleased to inform you that, following the selection process, we would like to offer you the position of {title}.

Our proposal:

Net salary: {salary}
Contract: {contract}
Start date: {start}
Working hours: {hours}
Place of work: {place}
Probation period: {probation}
Benefits: {benefits}
Other terms: {terms}
Offer valid until: {valid}

You will receive a separate e-mail from Golden A/S with a personal link, where you accept the offer and its start date. If you would like to discuss any point first, reply to this e-mail. We look forward to welcoming you to the team.

Job description
----------------------------------------
{jd}

{signature}',
'et.d_b_rc_rejected' => 'Dear {name},

Thank you for your application for the position of {title} and for the time you invested in our selection process.

After careful consideration we have decided to proceed with other candidates whose profile is closer to the requirements of this role. We will keep your details on file for six months and will contact you if a suitable position opens.

We wish you every success.

Best regards,
{user}
{branch}',
